      <title>微软为何移除Windows预装的扫雷纸牌和3D弹球</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260830/%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E7%A7%BB%E9%99%A4Windows%E9%A2%84%E8%A3%85%E7%9A%84%E6%89%AB%E9%9B%B7%E7%BA%B8%E7%89%8C%E5%92%8C3D%E5%BC%B9%E7%90%83/</link>
